{"meta":{"id":"prompt-log","category":"aide/common-rules","title":"프롬프트 로그 (AI 호출 JSONL)","subtitle":"","summary":"AI 호출 usage/content JSONL 분리·필드, 원문 기본 off·마스킹, 실패도 같은 파일, 프로세스 간 잠금, 여러 곳 로그 결합","tags":["aide","규칙","로그","ai"],"color":"indigo","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-indigo","source":"aide_agents/1-rules","updatedAt":"2026-10-18"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-indigo-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-indigo-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 border border-indigo-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></span>1-rules</span>\r\n<span class=\"text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wide text-stone-400 font-serif\">2026-10-18</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">프롬프트 로그 (AI 호출 JSONL)</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-indigo-50/70 border border-indigo-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-indigo-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> AI 호출 usage/content JSONL 분리·필드, 원문 기본 off·마스킹, 실패도 같은 파일, 프로세스 간 잠금, 여러 곳 로그 결합</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">기록</h2></div><div class=\"space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\"><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">AI 호출은 일반 로그와 분리해 <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">구조가 같은 JSONL</strong>로 — 프로젝트·언어가 달라도 모아서 분석</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">사용량과 원문은 <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">다른 파일</strong>, <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">일별 분할</strong>: <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>logs/prompt/usage_YYYY-MM-DD.jsonl</code>, <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>logs/prompt/content_YYYY-MM-DD.jsonl</code> — 같은 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>call_id</code>로 매칭</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">사용량 기본 켜짐, <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">원문 기본 꺼짐</strong> — <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>PROMPT_USAGE_LOG</code>, <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>PROMPT_CONTENT_LOG</code>, <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>PROMPT_LOG_DIR</code>, 실행 중·호출별로도 끌 수 있게</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">원문을 켤 때는 길이 상한·마스킹·보관 기간을 정한다. 마스킹은 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>params</code>·<code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>error</code>·추가 필드에도</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">실패·오류 호출도 같은 usage 파일에(<code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>status</code>로 구분) — 실패율의 분모가 같은 파일에 있어야 한다</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">여러 프로세스가 같은 파일에 쓰면 프로세스 간 잠금(Windows에서 줄이 섞이거나 사라진다)</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">async 서버는 큐 + 기록 스레드로 백그라운드 기록, 종료 시 남은 줄을 쓰고 큐가 넘치면 직접 쓴다</span></div></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">필드</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">파일</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">필드</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">usage</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>schema</code>, <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>ts</code>(ISO+타임존), <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>call_id</code>, <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>caller</code>, <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>name</code>, <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>version</code>, <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>system_hash</code>, <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>provider</code>, <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>model</code>, <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>params</code>, <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>usage{input/output/total_tokens}</code>, <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>latency_ms</code>, <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>status</code>(ok/error/length/refusal/invalid), <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>finish_reason</code>(제공자 원래 값), <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>error</code>, <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>ground{valid, invented}</code>, <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>content_logged</code></td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">content</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>schema</code>, <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>ts</code>, <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>call_id</code>, <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>name</code>, <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>version</code>, <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>system_hash</code>, <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>input{system, user}</code> 또는 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>input{messages}</code>, <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>output</code>, <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>truncated</code>, <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>masked</code></td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">prompt</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">usage 필드 전부 + <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>content{input, output, truncated, masked}</code>(원문 없으면 null)</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">제공자별 종료 사유는 공통 값으로 바꿔 넣는다: <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>max_tokens</code> → length, <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>content_filter</code>·<code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>SAFETY</code> → refusal.</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">결합</h2></div><div class=\"space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\"><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">원본(usage/content)은 고치지 않고 따로 만든다: usage + content → <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>prompt_YYYY-MM-DD.jsonl</code></span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">여러 곳(다른 PC·서버) 파일 합치기: <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>ts</code> 실제 시각순 정렬, 기준 타임존 날짜로 다시 일별 분할, 같은 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>call_id</code>는 한 줄(내용이 다르면 충돌 보고), 출처는 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>source</code></span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">앱이 쓰는 로그 폴더를 결합 결과 폴더로 쓰지 않는다. 표(HTML·CSV)로 뽑으면 원문이 그대로 들어가니 공유 범위를 로그와 같게</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-400\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">Python 구현: <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>3-modules/5-class/1-log/prompt_log/</code> (<code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>prompt_log.py</code> · <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>prompt_merge.py</code> · <code class='font-mono text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded'>prompt_view.py</code>)</span></div></div></div>\r\n","path":"aide/common-rules/prompt-log","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"aide","title":"aide","path":"aide"},{"id":"common-rules","title":"1-rules (공통 규칙)","path":"aide/common-rules"}],"hasImage":false}